[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glfw/glfw/issues/comments/452461495","html_url":"https://github.com/glfw/glfw/issues/1415#issuecomment-452461495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glfw/glfw/issues/1415","id":452461495,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ1MjQ2MTQ5NQ==","user":{"login":"zlsa","id":6366062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNjYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6366062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa","html_url":"https://github.com/zlsa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-01-08T21:39:58Z","updated_at":"2019-01-08T21:40:31Z","body":"Moving the `_glfwInputKey` call to outside of the `lastKeyTime` `if` statement in `src/x11_window.c` fixes the issue on my system:\r\n\r\n```c\r\n// Line 1259\r\n//if (window->x11.lastKeyTime < event->xkey.time)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \r\n//{                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \r\n//    if (keycode)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \r\n//        _glfwInputKey(window, key, keycode, GLFW_PRESS, mods);                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \r\n//                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \r\n//    window->x11.lastKeyTime = event->xkey.time;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  \r\n//}                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \r\n_glfwInputKey(window, key, keycode, GLFW_PRESS, mods);                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glfw/glfw/issues/comments/452461495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zlsa","id":6366062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNjYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6366062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa","html_url":"https://github.com/zlsa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zlsa/orgs","r